=== reading ===
If chi2 never beats the single-molecule baseline and k_ao4 is never adopted
with a chi2 gain, alpha-O-4's rejection is robust to topology: its only
action -- joining fragments -- is invisible to the six-linkage inventory, so
no inventory fit adopts it, multi-fragment or not. The oo_scale = 0 regime
reaches real fragments but loses 5-5 and 4-O-5 (which alpha-O-4 cannot make),
so it cannot be the better model the reviewer hypothesized.
